translate ja strings:

    old "A few yards, in a cage very similar to hers, she saw two shadow figures, moving."
    new "数ヤード先、彼女と似たような檻の中に、二人の影が動いていた。"

    old "A large orc stood near the cage, hitting the bars with a stick."
    new "巨大なオークが柵のそばに立って、棒で柵を叩いていた。"

    old "A ferocious screaming and roaring exploded as he was crowned the victor."
    new "勝者として王冠を戴いた瞬間、激しい叫びと咆哮が爆発した。"
